STRUE — Structural Truth Engine

Shunyaya Structural Truth Model

Legal Status

This license is a permissive Open Standard license for the STRUE reference implementation.

To the maximum extent permitted by applicable law, this license grants rights similar in spirit to permissive open-source licenses.

These rights apply subject to truthful representation requirements regarding use of the STRUE name and representation of the reference implementation.

If any provision is found unenforceable, remaining provisions remain in effect.

Nature of Release

This is a minimal, self-contained reference implementation.

It is intended to demonstrate structural truth preservation and observability — not to represent a filesystem replacement, storage platform, operating system component, database engine, or production observability infrastructure.

Behavioral observations apply only within the scope of the reference implementation and its defined structural assumptions.

